B.Zr=new A.k8("Welcome to the Rift","The Rift has torn the town in two, and things are climbing out of it. They walk the path round and round. If 100 get loose at once, it's over.","next")
B.Zq=new A.k8("Feed the machine","Tap SUMMON. Every penny in the Oracle-O-Matic gives you a random figurine, and they fight for you. Summon three.","summon")
B.Zp=new A.k8("Three of a kind","Same figurines stack, three to a cell. Tap a full stack and press MERGE, right under it, to squash them into one random figurine from the next tier up. Merging is how you get strong.","next")
B.Zt=new A.k8("Move them about","Drag a figurine onto another cell to swap them. Cells next to the path see the most action, so put your best ones there.","next")
